      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Talk live with a Vidu S2-Avatar character made from one photo. Queue the prompt, allow microphone access, and Maya, a travel planner, says hello in the Reactor Realtime window. Talk to her out loud, or type a message in the window. Wear headphones so she doesn't hear herself. Press Done to end the call; it is saved as a video under reactor/realtime. Cancel ends it without saving.\n\nVidu S2-Avatar prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/vidu-s2-avatar/prompt-guide\n\nThe greeting is her opening line and the persona is who she is; see the guide above. Pick a microphone in Reactor Microphone Capture, or remove it to use the browser's default. Copy example_inputs/ into ComfyUI's input folder first, and set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Talk live with a Vidu S2-Avatar character made from one photo. Queue the prompt, allow microphone access, and Maya, a travel planner, says hello in the Reactor Realtime window. Talk to her out loud, or type a message in the window. Wear headphones so she doesn't hear herself. Press Done to end the call; it is saved as a video under reactor/realtime. Cancel ends it without saving.\n\nVidu S2-Avatar prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/vidu-s2-avatar/prompt-guide\n\nThe greeting is her opening line and the persona is who she is; see the guide above. Pick a microphone in Reactor Microphone Capture, or remove it to use the browser's default. Copy example_inputs/ into ComfyUI's input folder first, and set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
